ll businesses, and mid-sized enterprises, enabling them to connect directly with their customers and grow the revenue of their businesses. We believe these services represent more efficient and less expensive solutions than many existing alternatives, and provide increased security, privacy, flexibility, and mobility. The MOZ Group offers its services under the following brands.","section":"Item 1. Business","block":124,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001084048-26-000005","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001084048","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1084048/000108404826000005/zd-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3.bin","sha256":"3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3"}},{"id":"1ddd14c0f3f8e2e4e417a10a420c3c83db826fc89d37d96db1593c9180e94f55","quote":"MOZ Pro, MOZ Local, and Stat Analytics offer search engine optimization services that are used to help understand and improve internet traffic, rankings, and visibility in search results.","context":"Campaigner, iContact, SMTP, Kickbox, Email Industries, and Full Contact provide email marketing solutions to help small, medium, and large businesses strengthen customer relationships and drive sales through professional email campaign creation, advanced list management, segmentation tools, verification tools, marketing automation, attribution reports, campaign tracking, and targeted email auto responders and workflows.","section":"Item 1. Business","block":125,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001084048-26-000005","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001084048","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1084048/000108404826000005/zd-20251231.htm","rawPath"