-000005","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001084048","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1084048/000108404826000005/zd-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3.bin","sha256":"3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3"}},{"id":"b79be6ef68d45b0bd41c1d307e8d636658e33791581aad794d6b547590bd7e8f","quote":"OCV Fund is considered a related party because it is an investment that is accounted for by the equity method. On September 25, 2017, the Company entered into a commitment to invest $200.0 million (approximately 76.6% of equity) in the OCV Fund. The primary purpose of the OCV Fund is to provide a limited number of select investors with the opportunity to realize long-term appreciation from public and private companies, with a particular focus on the technology and life science industries. The general activities of the OCV Fund is to buy, sell, hold, and otherwise invest in securities of every kind and nature and rights and options with respect thereto, including, without limitation, stock, notes, bonds, debentures, and evidence of indebtedness; to exercise all rights, powers, privileges, and other incidents of ownership or possession with respect to securities held or owned by the OCV Fund; to enter into, make and perform all contracts and other undertakings; and to engage in all activities and transactions as may be necessary, advisable, or desirable to carry out the foregoing.","context":"OCV Fund","section":"The accompanying Consolidated Statements of Operations reflect the results of operations of the 2023 acquisitions since the date of each respective acquisition.","block":1432,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001084048-26-000005","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001084048","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1084048/000108404826000005/zd-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3.bin","sha256":"3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"riskFactors":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"4cab95eb9dd149fe8260dbcef7e63d3c347ce42bf810dcc89ab13db44277108f","quote":"Before deciding to invest in Ziff Davis or to maintain or increase your investment, you should carefully consider the risks described below in addition to the other cautionary statements and risks described elsewhere in this Annual Report on Form 10-K and our other filings with the SEC, including our subsequent reports on Forms 10-Q and 8-K. The risks and uncertainties described below are not the only ones we face. Additional risks and uncertainties not presently known to us or that we currently deem immaterial also may affect our business. If any of these known or unknown risks or uncertainties actually occur, our business, prospects, financial condition, operating results, and cash flows could be materially adversely affected. In that event, the market price of our common stock will likely decline and you may lose part or all of your investment.","context":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":193,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001084048-26-000005","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001084048","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1084048/000108404826000005/zd-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3.bin","sha256":"3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3"}},{"id":"95ee4bd2bcc48ed83089309108df3e00a471ae4e20a8acb7030dec17d58e7aae","quote":"The following is a summary of the principal risks that could adversely affect our business, operations, and financial results.","context":"Risk Factors Summary","section":"Risk Factors Summary","block":195,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001084048-26-000005","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001084048","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1084048/000108404826000005/zd-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3.bin","sha256":"3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3"}},{"id":"1f3aefe3dfd046daa1079f888be3b52b77fc40b8d3b4296618cc19e298df6ab4","quote":"•If we are unable to identify and execute new acquisitions or execute on investment strategies, our growth may be negatively impacted.","context":"Risks Related To Our Business","section":"Risk Factors Summary","block":197,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001084048-26-000005","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001084048","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1084048/000108404826000005/zd-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3.bin","sha256":"3e95f488be19fa2b9fd45e8f7268fa08eba9ce7bd14667c0511dc36c7cb9b8b3"}},{"id":"78720d9178c19225921cc0951cbbb6421ff75abace743df73e94a7fd5fdb3bef","quote":"•Acquisitions may disrupt our operations and harm our operating results.","context":"•If we are unable to identify and execute new acquisitions or execute on investment strategies, our growth may be negatively impacted.","section":"Risk Factors Summary","block":198,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001084048-26-000005","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001084048","url":"htt